  "notes": "Waiver filing (Exhibit A, cash receipts and disbursements by fund, period 10/1/22-9/30/23; page 2a not in trim, page 1a shows no disbursements for its funds and page 2 Total column equals the page 2 fund columns). Governmental = General, Street, 13th Street Revenue Bond Payment, 13th Street Letter of Conditions, General Savings/MIA; business-type = Water Revenue Bond Payment, Water, Sewer, Water Debt Reserve/MIA, Water System Surplus, Water Letter of Conditions, and the Certificate of Deposit 105290 column (see decision_needed), same split as FY2024. Beginning/ending cash are line 3 / line 24 balances (net cash + investments); investments shown separately for information. Transfers per schedule p4: General (ARPA) to Street 5,525.45; Street to 13th Street Revenue Bond Payment 23,004.00 and 13th Street Letter of Conditions 3,312.00; Water to Water Revenue Bond Payment 36,504.00, Water Letter of Conditions 3,660.00, Water Debt Reserve 300.00 (all within one fund type; business-type transfers net 0). Solid Waste 228.00 is in the General Fund column (kept governmental). USDA-RD debt outstanding 934,064.23 (p4) not on the cash statement. County treasurer balance 374.61 at 10/1/22 and 843.07 at 9/30/23 printed below the statement, not in the roll-forward. No supplementary schedules; detail is per fund column of Exhibit A. Read pages 1-4 of 4"
